205
00:12:34.828 --> 00:12:37.367
Algorithm choice (L1 D, measured):

206
00:12:38.717 --> 00:12:40.082
Here is a quick table:

207
00:12:40.362 --> 00:12:44.010
Algorithm, and Sign, and Verify, and Token size, and Use.

208
00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:48.002
RS256 (RSA-2048).

209
00:12:48.282 --> 00:12:49.029
Sign:

210
00:12:49.309 --> 00:12:51.933
1,193 µs.

211
00:12:52.213 --> 00:12:53.087
Verify:

212
00:12:53.367 --> 00:12:54.903
47 µs.

213
00:12:55.183 --> 00:12:56.250
Token size:

214
00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:58.002
582 B.

215
00:12:58.282 --> 00:12:58.986
Use:

216
00:12:59.266 --> 00:13:03.021
Asymmetric; many verifiers, few signers (the common default).

217
00:13:03.301 --> 00:13:06.607
ES256 (P-256).

218
00:13:06.887 --> 00:13:07.634
Sign:

219
00:13:07.914 --> 00:13:09.514
208 µs.

220
00:13:09.794 --> 00:13:10.669
Verify:

221
00:13:10.949 --> 00:13:13.039
762 µs.

222
00:13:13.319 --> 00:13:14.386
Token size:

223
00:13:14.666 --> 00:13:16.245
326 B.

224
00:13:16.525 --> 00:13:17.229
Use:

225
00:13:17.509 --> 00:13:20.474
Smaller tokens, cheaper signing; verify-heavy.

226
00:13:20.754 --> 00:13:23.442
HS256 (shared secret).

227
00:13:23.722 --> 00:13:24.469
Sign:

228
00:13:24.749 --> 00:13:25.986
7 µs.

229
00:13:26.266 --> 00:13:27.141
