00:45:10.757 --> 00:45:29.871
OTP login control conformance (6-digit code, 1,000,000 possibilities). control naive hardened. legitimate owner with the real code, 200 logged in. wrong codes tolerated before lockout unlimited 5. codes issuable per phone or 10 min unlimited 3 (4th,

667
00:45:30.151 --> 00:45:46.834
then 429). guessing budget before code expires or locks n or a 5 tries versus 1e6 space about 1 in 200,000. then naive: unlimited attempts make a 6-digit code guessable; hardened: locked after.

668
00:45:47.114 --> 00:45:49.994
5, and codes are hashed at rest with expiry.

669
00:45:50.274 --> 00:45:50.957
B.

670
00:45:51.237 --> 00:46:09.242
OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code + PKCE conformance for the mobile app. request presented to or token naive hardened (BCP). correct verifier, registered redirect token issued token issued. wrong PKCE verifier token issued reject:

671
00:46:09.522 --> 00:46:13.149
