new JwtIssuerValidator(https://auth.grocery.example). audienceValidator(payment-api)));. return d;. // Object-level authorization (no IDOR): check the subject's relation to THIS order. @GetMapping(/orders/id).

748
00:55:42.971 --> 00:56:03.109
